s, providing the regional team with full visibility into the resolution process and service center performance.</span></p>\n","clientName":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">An automotive manufacturer with a strong market presence in the luxury segment.</span></p>\n","companyInfo":null,"keyBenefitsList":null,"projectCaseStudyFile":null,"technologyLogos":[{"altText":".Net Core","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/dot-net-logo.png"},{"altText":"Angular","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/angular-logo.png"},{"altText":"SQL Server","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/sql-server.webp"},{"altText":"Azure Hosting","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/azure-hoisting.webp"}],"testimonialAuthor":"Customer Service Manager","testimonialContent":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The CCMS application allows us to maintain the highest service standards by ensuring every customer escalation is tracked and resolved properly. It gives us the transparency we need to uphold our brand promise.</span></p>\n"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"cG9zdDo3MzIx"}},"staticQueryHashes":["3649515864"],"slicesMap":{"footer":"footer","navigation-bar":"navigation-bar"}}